WEBVTT

01:27.745 --> 01:31.025
ADAPTED FROM THE NOVEL "MY QUEEN"
BY XIE LOUNAN

01:47.305 --> 01:48.425
Enjoy, Your Majesty.

02:26.625 --> 02:27.465
So

02:28.105 --> 02:30.265
what did you put in the liquor?

02:32.145 --> 02:33.305
You know I spiked the drink,

02:35.065 --> 02:36.185
but you drank it still.

02:42.305 --> 02:43.145
I thought

02:43.785 --> 02:46.025
you had put some potent venom.

02:46.545 --> 02:49.065
So it was just
to trigger my cold sickness.

02:50.705 --> 02:52.705
I just need you to stay
here for one more night.

02:52.785 --> 02:53.665
I need the Phoenix Seal.

02:54.265 --> 02:55.745
Otherwise, I can't do much in the palace.

02:56.345 --> 02:59.065
My dear, you're too naive.

02:59.785 --> 03:01.145
You think keeping me here

03:01.225 --> 03:03.665
will get you the Phoenix Seal
from the Empress Dowager?

03:04.265 --> 03:05.705
Father aided you for many years.

03:05.785 --> 03:07.465
Empress Dowager Liu is our common enemy.

03:07.545 --> 03:09.585
You want your power. I have my goal.

03:09.665 --> 03:11.185
We can work together.

03:17.305 --> 03:20.025
Even willing to look past
what happened before?

03:24.865 --> 03:26.025
Yes.

03:27.865 --> 03:28.985
Xiaoyue, you're back.

03:29.665 --> 03:30.825
I don't want to talk about it.

03:49.145 --> 03:50.425
-Madam.
-Madam.

03:50.505 --> 03:51.985
What happened to His Majesty?

03:52.065 --> 03:56.065
Her Majesty
seems to have offended His Majesty.

03:56.665 --> 03:57.825
Ling Cangcang.

03:58.505 --> 04:00.185
Where is your respect?

04:10.945 --> 04:11.705
Who said you could come in?

04:12.785 --> 04:13.665
Get lost!

04:15.465 --> 04:16.305
Yes, Your Majesty.

04:26.145 --> 04:27.545
I am unable to ascertain

04:27.625 --> 04:28.905
what happened in the chamber.

04:29.505 --> 04:31.705
But His Majesty
was lashing out against Her Majesty.

04:31.785 --> 04:33.905
He even hollered at Imperial Preceptor Du
who barged in thereafter.

04:36.745 --> 04:38.665
It seems like Her Majesty hasn't earned

04:38.745 --> 04:40.625
His Majesty's favor.

04:40.705 --> 04:41.665
Indeed.

04:42.465 --> 04:45.425
It means nothing even if
she's the daughter of Ling Xuefeng.

04:46.145 --> 04:47.945
She's just a stepping stone

04:48.025 --> 04:50.225
for Xiao Huan to amass more power.

04:53.185 --> 04:55.265
Then shall we proceed with the plans

04:56.065 --> 04:56.905
we have devised against her?

04:57.505 --> 04:58.345
No need.

04:58.865 --> 05:01.505
A disfavored Empress is no threat.

05:02.625 --> 05:04.585
Xiao Huan doesn't love her.

05:05.385 --> 05:07.465
So she isn't my enemy.

05:08.065 --> 05:09.505
In that case,

05:09.585 --> 05:10.425
I'm sure

05:11.025 --> 05:13.545
she'll be too ashamed to
get the Phoenix Seal from you.

05:16.865 --> 05:18.305
By His Majesty's decree,

05:18.385 --> 05:20.905
Her Majesty's oversight has caused

05:20.985 --> 05:23.025
the resurgence of
His Majesty's cold sickness.

05:23.705 --> 05:26.665
As an act of punishment,

05:26.745 --> 05:29.585
His Majesty declares that from now on,

05:29.665 --> 05:32.105
Her Majesty cannot leave the inner palace.

05:32.185 --> 05:33.625
May Her Majesty profit

05:33.705 --> 05:37.225
from this period to reflect upon herself.

05:50.625 --> 05:52.505
Father. I have bad news.

05:54.705 --> 05:57.545
What is it? Why the panic?

05:57.625 --> 06:00.065
Her Majesty has been grounded.

06:08.345 --> 06:10.065
Grand Tutor Ling, did
you rush into the palace

06:10.145 --> 06:11.225
for whatever reason?

06:13.825 --> 06:17.105
I must have spoiled my daughter

06:17.705 --> 06:19.345
that she grew flippant.

06:19.425 --> 06:21.465
That's why you had to put her in place.

06:21.545 --> 06:25.825
I came to apologize on her behalf.

06:26.425 --> 06:27.625
It's not that serious, Grand Tutor Ling.

06:28.825 --> 06:30.505
The Empress poisoned my drink

06:31.345 --> 06:32.745
in an attempt to harm me.

06:32.825 --> 06:34.385
But I knew that if

06:34.465 --> 06:36.065
I punished the Empress
in accordance with the law,

06:36.145 --> 06:37.665
ministers in the court

06:37.745 --> 06:41.545
would think that
there was discord between us.

06:41.625 --> 06:43.145
So I made a declaration

06:43.225 --> 06:44.825
that the Empress had angered me

06:44.905 --> 06:46.585
and was grounded as a result.

06:46.665 --> 06:48.145
Are you happy

06:48.745 --> 06:49.865
with such an approach?

06:52.585 --> 06:54.025
Thank you for your mercy, Your Majesty.

06:54.105 --> 06:55.225
You're welcome.

06:56.625 --> 06:58.465
Alas, I am still plagued by my sickness.

06:58.545 --> 07:00.345
I count on you to handle

07:00.425 --> 07:02.705
the endless matters in the court.

07:03.985 --> 07:07.025
I wish to consult
your opinion on one matter.

07:08.705 --> 07:09.665
Do tell.

07:10.265 --> 07:11.545
The talent recommendation system

07:12.385 --> 07:14.865
will bring a boon to our nation.

07:14.945 --> 07:19.745
After several days of research
and deliberations,

07:19.825 --> 07:20.745
I've decided

07:20.825 --> 07:22.865
to agree with the suggestion
of the Ministry of Personnel.

07:22.945 --> 07:26.345
We should implement the system.

07:28.585 --> 07:31.505
I am glad to see your devotion

07:31.585 --> 07:33.945
to our national welfare, Grand Tutor Ling.

07:37.105 --> 07:39.665
LING MANOR

07:55.785 --> 07:57.665
Father. You're back.

08:01.465 --> 08:02.905
Fortunately, this drawing

08:03.585 --> 08:05.345
can yet be saved.

08:06.345 --> 08:09.705
Otherwise, I'll have
to discard and redraw it.

08:11.745 --> 08:14.185
Father, what did your visit
to the palace yield?

08:19.265 --> 08:20.385
What did it yield?

08:21.745 --> 08:23.585
His Majesty grounded Cangcang

08:24.185 --> 08:26.505
so that I'd agree to let

08:27.265 --> 08:28.785
Song Lanxi assume office in the Capital.

08:33.585 --> 08:34.825
He used Cangcang again.

08:35.425 --> 08:36.945
For my daughter,

08:37.024 --> 08:39.024
I'm willing to concede.

08:39.625 --> 08:41.545
-But Father…
-Don't worry.

08:42.144 --> 08:44.225
If I can raise a dragon,

08:44.865 --> 08:47.185
I can tame it.

08:49.625 --> 08:52.985
Once Cangcang is conceived with a child,

08:53.065 --> 08:56.465
a young emperor
who died before the age of 30

08:56.545 --> 08:57.625
won't be a threat.

08:59.905 --> 09:02.425
His Majesty implements
the talent recommendation system

09:03.025 --> 09:05.145
in order to shuffle
the current power dynamics in court.

09:06.545 --> 09:11.185
That will not do me or Liu any good.

09:14.745 --> 09:18.265
Even if I concede, I'm sure

09:19.985 --> 09:23.305
Liu will do something about it.

09:24.465 --> 09:26.905
His Majesty allows
Qing to return to the Capital?

09:26.985 --> 09:27.825
Yes.

09:28.425 --> 09:31.425
Because Qing has to escort that Song back?

09:31.505 --> 09:32.745
Song Lanxi.

09:33.425 --> 09:34.985
I knew he was up to no good.

09:35.665 --> 09:37.545
I disagreed with
the talent recommendation system.

09:37.625 --> 09:39.665
So he wants to use Qing to deal with me.

09:40.345 --> 09:43.185
Calm down, Your Majesty.
His Highness is coming back.

09:43.985 --> 09:45.265
You will be freed from the pain

09:45.345 --> 09:47.145
of missing your son.

09:47.905 --> 09:51.265
If Qing escorted
Song Lanxi to the Capital safely,

09:51.985 --> 09:54.345
Xiao Huan would be able
to implement the new policy.

09:54.425 --> 09:55.865
It would not do us any good.

09:55.945 --> 09:57.665
If they had an accident, however,

09:57.745 --> 09:59.865
Qing would bear full liability.

10:01.185 --> 10:02.505
Xiao Huan

10:03.225 --> 10:05.145
is getting smarter and smarter.

10:05.825 --> 10:07.865
What should we do then?

10:08.545 --> 10:10.825
Qing is at stake. I cannot act recklessly.

10:11.425 --> 10:12.865
We'll let them
return to the Capital safely.

10:14.545 --> 10:15.585
Fortunately for us, Song Lanxi

10:15.665 --> 10:18.705
is only slightly popular among the nobles.

10:18.785 --> 10:20.145
He is young and inexperienced.

10:21.025 --> 10:23.785
Using him to implement the new policy

10:24.305 --> 10:25.785
will not be as easy.

10:35.145 --> 10:37.825
It's late now.
Her Majesty must be asleep now.

10:39.625 --> 10:42.625
Xiaoyue who serves
the Empress works for the Dowager Empress.

10:42.705 --> 10:44.145
Find a way to get rid of her.

10:44.945 --> 10:47.065
I don't want any unscrupulous party

10:47.145 --> 10:49.185
to be working closely with her.

10:49.825 --> 10:50.865
It'll be done, Your Majesty.

10:52.705 --> 10:53.545
Wufu.

10:54.465 --> 10:56.225
The Empress's palace
could use some decorations.

10:56.905 --> 10:58.545
Find some art pieces

10:58.625 --> 11:00.145
and give them to her tomorrow.

11:00.705 --> 11:01.985
And tell her

11:02.065 --> 11:03.185
that the confinement has been lifted.

11:04.465 --> 11:05.785
Noted, Your Majesty.

11:05.865 --> 11:09.705
I'm sure Her Majesty will
appreciate Your Majesty's gesture

11:09.785 --> 11:12.025
once she received the drawings.

11:13.505 --> 11:14.465
Cangcang,

11:15.465 --> 11:16.985
I used you again.

11:18.265 --> 11:21.305
You must resent me even more now.

11:24.425 --> 11:26.305
-Here. Roll it.
-Okay.

11:46.985 --> 11:47.825
Your Majesty.

11:49.265 --> 11:51.705
Have you arranged for the candidates
to enter the Capital?

11:52.305 --> 11:53.545
Rest assured, Your Majesty.

11:53.625 --> 11:55.985
Shi Yan has brought the candidates to Chu.

11:56.065 --> 11:57.905
Fenglai Pavilion will assist further
and Prince of Yuzhang will escort them.

11:58.505 --> 12:00.425
Additionally,
Lingbi Sect is now left leaderless,

12:00.505 --> 12:01.345
and has suffered great loss.

12:01.425 --> 12:03.825
Their disciples are vying for power now.

12:03.905 --> 12:06.505
Ling Xuefeng will not
be able to do much for now.

12:06.585 --> 12:09.105
The Lingbi Sect might have fallen apart,
but it's not gone yet.

12:09.185 --> 12:11.665
Even though Ling Xuefeng
has lost his forces in the martial world,

12:11.745 --> 12:13.305
he still has murder thralls.

12:13.385 --> 12:14.225
We cannot underestimate him.

12:14.305 --> 12:15.345
Right.

12:16.105 --> 12:16.985
But Your Majesty,

12:17.665 --> 12:19.145
you are wary of the Grand Tutor.

12:19.225 --> 12:20.705
Why did you summon
Prince of Yuzhang back here?

12:23.145 --> 12:26.905
Because I can profit from some infighting.

12:44.905 --> 12:46.785
Your Majesty. Eunuch Feng is here.

12:52.385 --> 12:54.785
Greetings, Your Majesty.

12:55.385 --> 12:56.425
You're here, Eunuch Feng.

12:56.505 --> 12:58.425
His Majesty asked me

12:58.505 --> 13:01.065
to bring some drawings as gifts for you.

13:02.185 --> 13:03.305
Here.

13:07.905 --> 13:09.025
Allow me to thank His Majesty.

13:11.385 --> 13:13.345
Is he recovering from his cold sickness?

13:13.945 --> 13:15.705
Worry not, Your Majesty.

13:15.785 --> 13:19.545
His Majesty is doing well.
He is now discussing

13:19.625 --> 13:22.425
important matters
in Wuying Hall with Grand Tutor Ling.

13:31.385 --> 13:32.625
His Majesty sure is shrewd.

13:34.785 --> 13:35.945
Your Majesty,

13:36.025 --> 13:38.505
His Majesty misses you a lot.

13:39.185 --> 13:41.705
Look.
He also asked me to come here to tell you

13:41.785 --> 13:43.145
that your confinement had been lifted.

13:44.465 --> 13:45.505
The drawings…

13:47.305 --> 13:49.545
I understand, Eunuch Feng. You may return.

13:50.705 --> 13:51.745
Okay.

13:51.825 --> 13:52.985
By your leave.

13:59.545 --> 14:01.985
Your Majesty. Do you want to look
at His Majesty's gifts?

14:02.065 --> 14:04.065
No. Put them aside.

14:10.425 --> 14:13.145
SOUTHERN CHU

14:13.225 --> 14:16.825
FENGLAI PAVILION

14:16.905 --> 14:18.105
LIST OF CANDIDATES

14:18.185 --> 14:20.505
ZHANG YU, LIN CHUWEI

14:25.625 --> 14:27.745
I only have to escort
a few people back to the Capital.

14:28.345 --> 14:29.985
Why must I enlist
Fenglai Pavilion's help too?

14:30.665 --> 14:31.825
The martial world is dangerous,

14:31.905 --> 14:33.625
and our enemies hide in the shadows.
We must be careful.

14:34.225 --> 14:36.105
Besides, it's a precondition
for your return to the Capital.

14:39.785 --> 14:40.625
Fine.

14:41.705 --> 14:42.785
I cannot defy His Majesty's decree.

14:43.385 --> 14:47.065
If Fenglai Pavilion is assisting me,
how many of you will be there?

14:48.625 --> 14:51.425
Zhong Lin, Vice Sect Leader
of Fenglai Pavilion,

14:53.225 --> 14:55.945
will be at your service.

15:00.225 --> 15:02.865
I'll escort you back to the Capital.

15:14.425 --> 15:16.185
Miss Zhong, this is not right.

15:18.825 --> 15:19.865
You have been managing

15:19.945 --> 15:22.425
Fenglai Pavilion, Mr. Shi.

15:22.505 --> 15:25.385
I'm free and could use some exercise.

15:25.465 --> 15:26.305
What's wrong with that?

15:28.185 --> 15:30.425
You must be Miss Zhong.

15:32.585 --> 15:35.505
I haven't settled
the score of that hideous tattoo.

15:35.585 --> 15:37.345
And here you are, surrendering yourself.

15:45.465 --> 15:46.505
Your Highness.

15:47.145 --> 15:49.505
You want a peacock tattoo.

15:49.585 --> 15:50.505
That's easy.

15:51.785 --> 15:53.625
Once you bring me to the Capital,

15:53.705 --> 15:55.465
I'll modify your tattoo into a peacock.

15:57.185 --> 15:58.385
Bring you to the Capital?

16:00.105 --> 16:02.825
Do you want to see Ling Cangcang?

16:06.465 --> 16:07.945
Sorry.

16:08.025 --> 16:10.905
I was born selfish.

16:10.985 --> 16:14.065
Altruism is not in my nature.

16:18.745 --> 16:21.545
What a shame.

16:24.505 --> 16:25.345
Shi Yan.

16:26.065 --> 16:27.505
There's only one such name list.

16:28.585 --> 16:29.505
Is that right?

16:43.025 --> 16:45.545
Miss Zhong. What are you doing?

16:46.225 --> 16:48.465
I don't have many talents,
but I have a good memory.

16:49.465 --> 16:51.945
The name, age, physical descriptions,

16:52.025 --> 16:53.145
and habits

16:53.225 --> 16:55.145
of the candidates on the name list

16:55.225 --> 16:57.305
are all seared in my mind.

16:58.305 --> 16:59.345
However,

16:59.945 --> 17:03.305
if Your Highness insists on
not bringing me back to the Capital,

17:03.385 --> 17:04.464
I'll miss Cangcang so much

17:04.545 --> 17:06.065
and fall into depression.

17:06.145 --> 17:09.825
When that happens,
I might just forget everything.

17:15.944 --> 17:17.464
The powder you used just now…

17:17.545 --> 17:18.665
It's phosphor.

17:20.345 --> 17:22.825
And the different pouches you're carrying…

17:22.905 --> 17:25.505
They contain different powders
with different effects.

17:26.905 --> 17:28.224
Wow.

17:28.305 --> 17:30.385
Miss Zhong, you are brave and smart.

17:30.465 --> 17:31.825
You will come with us.

17:32.505 --> 17:35.665
But no. Your Highness,
His Majesty asked me to come with you.

17:37.425 --> 17:41.345
The entire Fenglai Pavilion
can come with me.

17:52.505 --> 17:54.585
Your Highness, why did His Majesty

17:54.665 --> 17:57.265
summon you back to the Capital?

17:57.865 --> 18:00.145
Who knows what happened in his crazy mind?

18:00.825 --> 18:02.465
But knowing him,

18:03.145 --> 18:04.465
it's not a good thing.

18:07.225 --> 18:09.065
But I haven't returned in many years.

18:09.665 --> 18:11.585
I do miss Mother and Ying.

18:11.665 --> 18:12.945
FENGLAI PAVILION

18:13.025 --> 18:14.465
We'll cross the bridge when we get there.

18:15.825 --> 18:17.985
Zhong Lin is witty and cunning.

18:18.585 --> 18:19.945
Why did you pick her, Your Highness?

18:20.505 --> 18:21.625
Are you dumb?

18:22.425 --> 18:23.505
Shi Yan works for His Majesty.

18:24.625 --> 18:25.785
Right.

18:25.865 --> 18:28.265
Putting you on escort duty must be a trap.

18:28.865 --> 18:30.425
If Shi Yan pulls
a trick during the journey

18:30.505 --> 18:32.505
and the candidates are in danger,
you'll be implicated.

18:33.185 --> 18:35.265
Zhong Li doesn't get
along with Shi Yan well.

18:36.665 --> 18:39.705
Wise choice, Your Highness.
Ask everyone in the manor to get ready.

18:39.785 --> 18:42.265
-I want to return to the Capital already.
-Are you not taking me, Your Highness?

18:42.345 --> 18:43.665
For you to mess everything up?

18:43.745 --> 18:46.145
Stay here to watch Shi Yan closely.

18:59.585 --> 19:01.425
Your Majesty,
for once, you're in a good mood.

19:01.505 --> 19:02.745
Did something good happen?

19:03.465 --> 19:05.145
A friend outside of
the palace wrote to me,

19:05.225 --> 19:06.505
saying that she'd be in the Capital soon.

19:07.185 --> 19:09.865
Speaking of which,
we haven't met for a while. I miss her.

19:09.945 --> 19:11.105
How wonderful.

19:11.185 --> 19:12.785
I'm happy for you, Your Majesty.

19:16.185 --> 19:18.145
The Begonia Pendant lit up.

19:19.985 --> 19:20.945
PRISTINE INTEGRITY

19:21.025 --> 19:22.105
What is this place?

19:22.785 --> 19:23.865
Your Majesty,

19:23.945 --> 19:27.185
this is the cold palace
where Princess Ying resides.

19:28.185 --> 19:29.185
A cold palace?

19:31.465 --> 19:33.145
How come I've never heard of this place?

19:33.945 --> 19:35.105
And who is Princess Ying?

19:35.185 --> 19:36.745
It's only normal
that you did not know, Your Majesty.

19:36.825 --> 19:39.545
Princess Ying is
a taboo subject in the palace.

19:39.625 --> 19:41.625
No one brings her up.

19:43.545 --> 19:44.825
Tell me more.

19:46.265 --> 19:48.905
Tell me. We are alone here.

19:52.145 --> 19:53.665
Well,

19:53.745 --> 19:55.945
Princess Ying is
the Empress Dowager's adoptive daughter.

19:56.025 --> 19:57.105
Her birth mother passed away early.

19:57.705 --> 19:59.705
Prince of Yuzhang
brought her back to Xuanguang Hall.

19:59.785 --> 20:02.985
When she was little,
she was close to His Majesty.

20:03.065 --> 20:05.745
But then, there was
an inferno all of a sudden

20:05.825 --> 20:06.745
and she almost lost her life there.

20:06.825 --> 20:08.385
Princess Ying suffered a great shock.

20:08.465 --> 20:10.985
She became addled upon being rescued.

20:11.065 --> 20:12.265
They had no choice

20:12.345 --> 20:13.665
but to put her here.

20:15.705 --> 20:17.225
An inferno all of a sudden?

20:20.065 --> 20:22.585
Why would the Empress Dowager
let her only daughter

20:22.665 --> 20:24.185
stay in such a forsaken place?

20:24.945 --> 20:26.225
Actually,

20:26.785 --> 20:29.185
that is Princess Ying's own decision.

20:29.785 --> 20:30.825
After she survived the inferno,

20:31.425 --> 20:33.345
she became afraid of her own palace.

20:34.025 --> 20:35.145
But wherever she relocated to,

20:35.225 --> 20:36.505
she would run out in distress.

20:37.185 --> 20:38.825
She only manages to calm herself down

20:38.905 --> 20:40.465
in the cold palace.

20:41.185 --> 20:44.185
The Empress Dowager had no other choice.

20:53.185 --> 20:54.065
Let's go.

21:16.705 --> 21:18.705
The Begonia Pendant never lights up,

21:18.785 --> 21:20.505
but it reacts to the cold palace.

21:20.585 --> 21:21.505
How odd.

22:26.505 --> 22:28.145
Do not touch my belongings!

22:29.505 --> 22:32.265
XIAO YING, PRINCESS OF GREAT QI

23:02.505 --> 23:03.865
I do not like you.

23:04.905 --> 23:06.025
Go away.

23:08.465 --> 23:10.145
You don't know me.

23:10.225 --> 23:11.185
Why do you not like me?

23:11.265 --> 23:12.905
I know who you are.

23:15.185 --> 23:17.225
His Majesty got married the other day.

23:17.305 --> 23:18.665
No one invited me,

23:19.625 --> 23:21.705
but I snuck out to watch the ceremony.

23:24.385 --> 23:25.625
I hate you.

23:28.705 --> 23:31.905
I hate anyone who has ties with Xiao Huan.

23:35.545 --> 23:37.185
Then you should like me.

23:37.265 --> 23:40.065
Because I hate Xiao Huan too.

23:42.665 --> 23:43.865
Why did you marry him then?

23:47.545 --> 23:48.505
I had no choice.

23:50.945 --> 23:52.265
You are able-bodied.

23:52.865 --> 23:54.185
What do you mean you had no choice?

23:57.905 --> 24:00.625
I came to ask you something.

24:01.225 --> 24:02.545
Maybe you could help me.

24:07.465 --> 24:08.865
Do you recognize this Begonia Pendant?

24:16.425 --> 24:18.585
If you kill Xiao Huan for me,

24:19.345 --> 24:20.265
I'll tell you everything.

24:22.345 --> 24:23.225
What?

24:23.305 --> 24:24.585
You don't want him killed?

24:29.705 --> 24:31.785
Then you don't hate him for real.

24:34.185 --> 24:35.345
Go away.

24:40.585 --> 24:41.545
I want him killed.

24:42.345 --> 24:44.825
But he is the Emperor.
No one can kill him easily.

24:45.825 --> 24:46.665
I can.

24:49.425 --> 24:51.545
What? Are you scared now?

24:54.305 --> 24:56.945
If you are scared, you can still run.

24:57.665 --> 25:00.585
Otherwise, I might kill you too.

25:11.705 --> 25:14.265
You only chase me out because you can't

25:14.865 --> 25:16.225
answer my question.

25:18.745 --> 25:20.945
You don't know what it is at all.

25:21.025 --> 25:23.025
And you don't know why it lit up.

25:26.425 --> 25:28.825
-I do!
-Then tell me.

25:41.905 --> 25:43.065
Azure firefly.

25:45.025 --> 25:46.105
You know many things.

25:47.105 --> 25:51.065
Yes. This is an azure firefly as
recorded in the Tome of All Venom

25:54.305 --> 25:56.745
It grew up ingesting
the poisonous powder I made.

26:12.705 --> 26:14.225
It is afraid of my pendant.

26:16.145 --> 26:17.225
Amazing.

26:17.825 --> 26:19.505
It scares my firefly.

26:25.305 --> 26:26.465
Your pendant

26:26.545 --> 26:28.385
must have contained Wanwei Herb,

26:28.465 --> 26:29.625
a precious herb

26:30.785 --> 26:33.825
that will light up to expel
all venomous creatures near it.

26:33.905 --> 26:34.985
With it,

26:35.985 --> 26:37.705
no venomous bugs can hurt you.

26:42.305 --> 26:44.545
Why would Master
give me a special artifact

26:45.305 --> 26:47.505
as an ordinary accessory?

26:49.865 --> 26:52.265
Where did you get this amazing artifact?

26:58.105 --> 26:59.105
My master gave it to me.

27:00.585 --> 27:02.145
Your master is so sweet.

27:08.665 --> 27:10.545
He was very kind to me.

27:11.145 --> 27:11.985
But

27:14.505 --> 27:15.585
he was killed.

27:20.385 --> 27:21.705
By Xiao Huan?

27:23.025 --> 27:24.985
That's why you hate him.

27:27.985 --> 27:28.825
Yes.

27:33.625 --> 27:37.065
I have a limitless supply of poisons.

27:37.705 --> 27:39.305
I can help you kill him.

28:03.825 --> 28:06.185
Your Majesty,
Her Majesty went to the cold palace.

28:08.185 --> 28:09.345
Cold palace?

28:10.545 --> 28:11.385
What for?

28:12.065 --> 28:14.745
Princess Ying said
she wanted to help her kill you.

28:15.425 --> 28:16.345
Your Majesty,

28:16.425 --> 28:18.305
allow me to bring her back.

28:18.385 --> 28:19.465
No need.

28:19.545 --> 28:22.145
Your Majesty,
I am worried about Her Majesty.

28:22.225 --> 28:23.625
Princess Ying might hurt her.

28:23.705 --> 28:24.585
She won't.

28:25.305 --> 28:27.665
They have a common enemy.

28:28.505 --> 28:31.425
Xiao Ying wants to use her to kill me.
She won't hurt her.

28:32.505 --> 28:34.625
Worry not, Your Majesty.
Her Majesty did not agree to her request.

28:38.185 --> 28:40.385
LINGHE HALL

28:40.465 --> 28:42.625
Stop drinking, Your Majesty.
It's bad for your health.

28:45.185 --> 28:46.065
No,

28:47.065 --> 28:48.025
it's bad if I don't drink it.

28:48.625 --> 28:51.025
You're drunk, Your Majesty.
You should stop drinking.

28:53.505 --> 28:54.905
Drunk?

28:56.025 --> 28:57.185
I'm not drunk.

29:00.625 --> 29:01.585
You don't believe me?

29:02.185 --> 29:03.025
Come.

29:06.865 --> 29:08.865
Let's have an arm wrestle.

29:08.945 --> 29:10.985
Zhong Lin and I played it a lot.

29:11.065 --> 29:12.545
And she never won.

29:13.265 --> 29:15.465
-Come.
-Your Majesty, you're teasing me again.

29:15.545 --> 29:16.745
You're a heroine.

29:16.825 --> 29:18.545
I can't win even if you're drunk.

29:21.305 --> 29:22.625
Heroine?

29:27.905 --> 29:29.185
I'm not a heroine.

29:31.545 --> 29:32.545
I'm just

29:33.425 --> 29:37.425
a caged canary bird.

29:41.225 --> 29:42.265
Drink up!

29:44.745 --> 29:46.065
Be careful, Your Majesty.

29:46.145 --> 29:47.465
You soaked the drawings.

29:51.665 --> 29:53.865
Your Majesty, I didn't
expect to see this side of you.

29:53.945 --> 29:55.185
You're so cool

29:55.265 --> 29:56.505
and free-spirited.

29:56.585 --> 29:58.665
I'm sure the author of this drawing

29:58.745 --> 30:00.345
must be very close to you.

30:02.265 --> 30:03.465
Why do you say so?

30:03.545 --> 30:05.425
Because Your Majesty
smiles so brightly in the drawing.

30:06.025 --> 30:08.705
I've never seen you like this.

30:26.945 --> 30:29.305
His Majesty has arrived.

30:36.825 --> 30:37.985
Why did you come here?

30:43.545 --> 30:44.385
To apologize.

30:56.425 --> 30:57.465
Apologize?

30:58.425 --> 30:59.825
I spiked your drink.

30:59.905 --> 31:00.905
You committed no fault.

31:11.185 --> 31:12.545
If that's the case,

31:12.625 --> 31:14.705
would you want to drink with me?

31:16.825 --> 31:18.385
What if I poisoned you again?

31:18.985 --> 31:20.145
It doesn't matter.

31:35.225 --> 31:36.345
Come.

31:37.025 --> 31:37.905
Drink up.

31:39.625 --> 31:40.545
Do you remember

31:41.065 --> 31:42.985
the first time we climbed to the roof?

31:46.385 --> 31:47.985
The audacity of you to bring it up.

31:53.025 --> 31:54.065
I bet

31:57.345 --> 31:59.185
I've always been the bargaining chip

31:59.265 --> 32:01.745
for you to fight against my father.

32:03.825 --> 32:04.785
Tell me now.

32:05.905 --> 32:07.585
What is your agenda this time?

32:11.025 --> 32:12.025
Whatever justification

32:13.025 --> 32:14.625
I bring up will be useless.

32:14.705 --> 32:15.865
Exactly.

32:16.825 --> 32:18.305
I don't believe

32:19.265 --> 32:20.865
in any word you say.

32:23.385 --> 32:24.385
What about the Phoenix Seal?

32:25.785 --> 32:26.625
Do you still want it?

32:32.105 --> 32:33.065
What?

32:34.905 --> 32:36.505
Are you helping me?

32:40.745 --> 32:42.625
Or lying to me?

32:44.745 --> 32:46.225
Lying to me again.

32:49.705 --> 32:50.665
Come.

32:51.705 --> 32:52.585
Drink up.

33:15.825 --> 33:18.545
Look. Our relationship

33:18.625 --> 33:19.505
is just

33:20.385 --> 33:23.865
like this cup.

33:23.945 --> 33:25.185
It's broken.

33:27.305 --> 33:28.625
It's broken.

33:31.945 --> 33:32.985
No.

33:34.385 --> 33:36.425
Our relationship

33:36.505 --> 33:38.505
is just a pipe dream of mine.

33:41.865 --> 33:44.425
Cangcang. You're drunk.

33:45.465 --> 33:46.705
No, I'm not.

33:47.545 --> 33:48.785
I just

33:51.105 --> 33:52.545
don't get it.

33:54.585 --> 33:56.425
Why did you kill my master?

33:59.465 --> 34:01.145
I don't get it.

34:03.225 --> 34:05.185
Did you approach me

34:08.824 --> 34:11.145
just to kill my master?

34:14.264 --> 34:15.185
Cangcang.

34:16.784 --> 34:18.225
I'm serious about you.

34:20.545 --> 34:21.865
And your serious commitment

34:23.304 --> 34:24.545
can kill.

34:33.824 --> 34:34.665
Drink up!

34:48.025 --> 34:48.865
Are you happy?

34:50.705 --> 34:51.905
Let's find our new ally.

35:10.105 --> 35:12.185
No wonder you won't kill Xiao Huan.

35:14.185 --> 35:15.385
He

35:17.745 --> 35:19.545
likes you.

35:25.665 --> 35:26.785
Come in, mister.

35:32.545 --> 35:33.385
I'm coming!

35:34.705 --> 35:35.705
Come inside.

35:50.785 --> 35:51.705
How may I help, sir?

35:52.305 --> 35:53.545
It's summer now.

35:53.625 --> 35:54.625
You must have fresh pufferfish.

35:55.785 --> 35:57.665
We are a group of 30-something travelers.

35:57.745 --> 36:00.265
One braised pufferfish
with rushes for everyone, please.

36:00.865 --> 36:01.905
Sir,

36:01.985 --> 36:03.985
we do have pufferfish.

36:04.065 --> 36:06.305
But unfortunately, we don't have a chef

36:06.385 --> 36:07.345
who can cook pufferfish here.

36:14.665 --> 36:15.825
Gold?

36:15.905 --> 36:17.785
You shall have fresh pufferfish tonight!

36:17.865 --> 36:20.225
You will be served our best Sangluo Wine

36:20.305 --> 36:22.105
as well.

36:22.185 --> 36:23.745
Come. Follow me.

36:31.225 --> 36:32.265
Let's go.

36:32.825 --> 36:34.825
Xiao Qianqing made
a huge deal out of his escort duty

36:34.905 --> 36:36.625
with regards to the candidates.

36:36.705 --> 36:38.425
Everyone knows about it.

36:42.505 --> 36:43.585
I found

36:44.225 --> 36:45.905
this new blade for you.

36:45.985 --> 36:46.905
It's light and gentle.

36:48.225 --> 36:50.745
You have trouble using a blade
due to your missing right index finger.

36:50.825 --> 36:53.465
This blade will suit you well.

36:59.265 --> 37:00.105
Thank you, Father.

37:01.105 --> 37:02.305
Xiao Qianqing.

37:03.385 --> 37:06.065
They call him the Peacock Prince.

37:06.705 --> 37:09.745
He isn't as superficial as he seems.

37:10.945 --> 37:12.945
He's returning to the Capital in grandeur

37:13.025 --> 37:16.265
because he wants to meddle
in the implementation of the new system.

37:16.345 --> 37:18.425
We cannot give him
the opportunity to do this.

37:18.985 --> 37:20.425
You must

37:21.065 --> 37:24.185
eliminate Song Lanxi and the rest.

37:24.825 --> 37:27.905
Kill everyone you think is your target.

37:28.505 --> 37:29.905
I know you are rich,

37:30.705 --> 37:32.265
but it's better to lie low

37:33.305 --> 37:34.665
when you're escorting
someone to the Capital.

37:35.825 --> 37:37.185
A humble peacock

37:37.985 --> 37:39.105
is no different from a fowl.

37:43.185 --> 37:45.505
If someone has ill intentions,

37:46.105 --> 37:47.545
being discreet will not make a difference.

37:49.785 --> 37:50.865
You're so gullible.

37:56.585 --> 37:57.825
An unfallen mulberry leaf

37:58.665 --> 37:59.825
is endowed with plump leaves.

38:00.945 --> 38:02.105
A fallen mulberry leaf

38:02.945 --> 38:04.225
is crisp and mellow.

38:11.345 --> 38:14.025
The Sangluo Wine
mustn't be savored like this.

38:15.505 --> 38:16.345
Servants!

38:18.665 --> 38:21.625
-Sir.
-Bring my ice here.

38:21.705 --> 38:22.545
Sure.

38:27.865 --> 38:29.145
You are a heroine, yes.

38:29.825 --> 38:30.785
But rolling your eyes

38:31.825 --> 38:33.065
is an indecent thing to do.

38:39.905 --> 38:42.945
I will attend to other officials.
Enjoy your meal.

38:54.145 --> 38:55.985
I have a question.

38:57.105 --> 39:01.065
Song Lanxi is just a new, lowly candidate.

39:01.145 --> 39:01.985
Why must we kill him?

39:05.105 --> 39:07.105
Who Song Lanxi is doesn't matter.

39:07.185 --> 39:08.225
What matters

39:08.825 --> 39:11.665
is his tutor, Li Chengtian.

39:12.385 --> 39:15.785
He was my rival
in the court for many years,

39:16.545 --> 39:18.705
and gave me many headaches.

39:20.105 --> 39:22.705
While he retired many years ago,

39:23.385 --> 39:25.185
his influence runs deep

39:25.985 --> 39:27.505
and can still be felt.

39:29.705 --> 39:32.825
The moral ones
in the court view him as a leader.

39:34.625 --> 39:35.705
I understand now.

39:36.265 --> 39:38.385
If Xiao Huan uses Song Lanxi to entice

39:38.465 --> 39:40.385
Li Chengtian into coming back,

39:40.465 --> 39:41.585
that will be a threat to us.

39:42.265 --> 39:43.545
Song Lanxi

39:43.625 --> 39:46.945
is Li Chengtian's student
after he went into retirement.

39:47.745 --> 39:48.945
Not many know that.

39:50.225 --> 39:53.065
Even I only found out recently.

39:53.665 --> 39:55.625
Again, His Majesty

39:57.785 --> 39:59.145
is one step ahead of me.

40:01.865 --> 40:02.745
It's my fault.

40:08.785 --> 40:11.585
We have lost our head start.

40:11.665 --> 40:13.705
You cannot make any mistakes now.

40:14.465 --> 40:17.105
And make sure to leave no traces behind
that reveal who you are.

40:17.185 --> 40:18.505
Yes, Father.

40:18.585 --> 40:20.425
I will not let you down.

41:55.225 --> 41:57.465
Your Majesty, please put it on.

41:57.545 --> 41:58.705
It's okay. I'm not cold.

41:58.785 --> 42:00.985
Your Majesty, it's late and misty now.

42:01.065 --> 42:03.185
Even if you're not cold,
you must make sure you won't catch a cold.

42:05.265 --> 42:06.625
I'm fine.

42:16.185 --> 42:17.225
This is…

42:17.865 --> 42:19.265
Someone wants to see me.

42:35.065 --> 42:37.265
They worked together flawlessly

42:37.945 --> 42:39.025
and killed them in one slash.

42:39.545 --> 42:40.545
They left none alive.

42:41.265 --> 42:43.505
What a professional group of assassins.

42:44.105 --> 42:46.305
It's good that you found criminals
on the death row to impersonate them.

42:46.985 --> 42:49.425
Do you understand why
I maintain a high profile now?

42:50.105 --> 42:51.265
Yes.

42:51.905 --> 42:53.465
It's just a small trick.

42:54.305 --> 42:55.785
What small trick?

42:56.825 --> 42:58.865
I am brave and wise.

42:58.945 --> 43:00.385
My tactics are unrivaled.

43:00.465 --> 43:03.225
We still have to exercise caution.

43:03.825 --> 43:05.185
The Capital is far.

43:05.265 --> 43:06.745
We might run into another incident.

43:07.425 --> 43:09.665
I must live till I get to the Capital
and find Cangcang.

43:10.265 --> 43:12.705
Don't worry. You can count on me.

43:13.345 --> 43:14.625
Bad news!

43:14.705 --> 43:15.665
Bad news!

43:17.065 --> 43:18.705
Your Highness. Official Song…

43:19.385 --> 43:21.945
-What happened?
-For some reason, Official Song

43:22.025 --> 43:23.265
left on his own.

43:23.345 --> 43:24.345
When I found him,

43:24.425 --> 43:25.785
he was barely alive.

43:25.865 --> 43:26.705
He will die soon.

43:27.385 --> 43:30.025
We did everything we could,
but it was still not enough.

43:30.705 --> 43:31.745
What do we do now?

43:32.345 --> 43:34.025
Official Song is a priority.

43:34.705 --> 43:36.305
If something happens to him,

43:37.265 --> 43:39.905
Xiao Huan will say
that I failed in my duty to escort him.

43:41.025 --> 43:42.625
I cannot let this happen.

43:43.425 --> 43:44.825
Let me think of a solution.
